sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant Main as 主 Agent
    participant Host as ACP 客户端代码
    participant Runner as 外部巡检程序
    User->>Main: 核对 readings.csv
    Main->>Host: 调用委派工具
    Host->>Runner: 启动子进程
    Host->>Runner: initialize 协议握手
    Runner-->>Host: 协议版本和能力
    Host->>Runner: session/new 指定工作目录
    Runner-->>Host: 返回 sessionId
    Host->>Runner: session/prompt 发巡检任务
    Runner-->>Host: session/update 已核对 3 条
    Runner-->>Host: session/update 2 条要复核
    Runner-->>Host: 本轮结束 end_turn
    Host-->>Main: 返回汇总好的工具结果
    Main-->>User: 展示设备和触发规则
